{"5011720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spooky Tales and Mummy Trails", "steam_appid": 5011720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A spooky, cosy 2.5D Platforming Halloween Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was supposed to be a normal halloween eve, but when 2 brother find an old spellbook, things turn chaotic as one gets turned into a Mummy and runs away. Time for a rescue missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your magic wand and wizard costume to embark on a quest across 14 vibrant, action packed levels to break the curse and bring your brother home in this short but charming all hallows eve game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 handcrafted levels. Dash through neighborhood streets, graveyard, eerie forests and more pack with spooky platforming hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical Combat. Blast spooky creatures with your magic or use your slide or double jump to get past the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun mini games. Take a break from the main road to beat the mini challenges like a haunted volleyball match as you continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect sweet treat to unlock stylish new hats and wands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy and Spooky aesthic. Enjoy a charming, non scary  Halloween game thats great for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and sweet. This game wont take hundreds of hours to beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A spooky, cosy 2.5D Platforming Halloween Adventure</strong></p><p class=